{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u>SEND YOUNG WARD TO SACRIFICE:</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the Intendant of the Corvus, your sacred duty is to prepare promising Wards for their ascending voyage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/35f9b29b4e71e20c4b8e55dd3b742fc8.poster.avif?t=1765310600\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/35f9b29b4e71e20c4b8e55dd3b742fc8.webm?t=1765310600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/35f9b29b4e71e20c4b8e55dd3b742fc8.mp4?t=1765310600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of a Ward of the Corvus and carve your way through the interconnected islands of the Krom Archipelago to end the evil consuming this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/d1dcdb6a695d943fd1b37ab3c2a05084.poster.avif?t=1765310600\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/d1dcdb6a695d943fd1b37ab3c2a05084.webm?t=1765310600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/d1dcdb6a695d943fd1b37ab3c2a05084.mp4?t=1765310600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  <br>Face formidable enemies in epic battles and uncover countless secrets with every new sacrificial attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/303f0c6e80cf68d70a39dd93f3a80db6.poster.avif?t=1765310600\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/303f0c6e80cf68d70a39dd93f3a80db6.webm?t=1765310600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/303f0c6e80cf68d70a39dd93f3a80db6.mp4?t=1765310600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their ultimate purpose? To sacrifice themselves to the Gate and delay the spreading corruption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/7f090f29dfbf1729f689b7731d78d4f5.poster.avif?t=1765310600\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/7f090f29dfbf1729f689b7731d78d4f5.webm?t=1765310600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/7f090f29dfbf1729f689b7731d78d4f5.mp4?t=1765310600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Succeed in your mission, and you'll extract valuable resources and powerful new equipment, ensuring the next generation of Wards is even stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/9982d7d51a8670d026423bcf046a4fe9.poster.avif?t=1765310600\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/9982d7d51a8670d026423bcf046a4fe9.webm?t=1765310600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/9982d7d51a8670d026423bcf046a4fe9.mp4?t=1765310600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But fail... and face the terrifying wrath of the Corvus!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1490990?t=1765310600","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1490990?t=1765310600","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/e881f0ec025b5148f576af8396a4b9e0eede84b7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765310600","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/e881f0ec025b5148f576af8396a4b9e0eede84b7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765310600","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u>SEND YOUNG WARD TO SACRIFICE:</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the Intendant of the Corvus, your sacred duty is to prepare promising Wards for their ascending voyage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/35f9b29b4e71e20c4b8e55dd3b742fc8.poster.avif?t=1765310600\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/35f9b29b4e71e20c4b8e55dd3b742fc8.webm?t=1765310600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/35f9b29b4e71e20c4b8e55dd3b742fc8.mp4?t=1765310600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of a Ward of the Corvus an